Package: atlas-spatial-runtime
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: Sunnyside <engineering@sunnyside.local>
Depends: libusb-1.0-0, passwd, python3 (>= 3.12), python3 (<< 3.13), systemd, udev
Description: Atlas native depth-camera runtime
 Atlas Spatial Runtime owns calibrated depth acquisition and local health for
 an optional onboard depth camera. It uses DepthAI directly without ROS or
 Docker and is configured by atlas-setup after installation.
